1
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:49,640
(Episode 3)

2
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:51,000
(This is a work of fiction.)

3
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:01,520
Your Honor, the video now has audio.

4
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:04,000
We need time
to re-examine this evidence.

5
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,440
It's the same video.

6
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:08,040
It's not like the audio
just appeared.

7
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:10,400
I don't see any need
to give you more time.

8
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,560
Why did you take Chung away?

9
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,240
Chung asked me to bring him here.

10
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,680
Do you take me for a fool?

11
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,360
Our son isn't here.
What are you doing here?

12
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:29,880
I know, you want
to seduce my husband, you wench!

13
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:30,960
Hey!

14
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:33,560
I'm the one who asked her
to bring me up.

15
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:35,880
So she wouldn't stay home
and be bullied by you all day.

16
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:39,120
Now you're taking her side
and blaming me instead?

17
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,720
She takes good care of me.

18
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:43,360
But you're always picking on her.

19
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,440
Last time, I couldn't breathe.

20
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:48,800
If it wasn't for her,
I would be dead by now.

21
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:51,480
Are you thinking with your privates,
or is the cancer in your brain?

22
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,160
Do you think she's actually
attracted to your wrinkles?

23
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,160
She's just after your money.

24
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:57,640
You're acting like a common shrew.

25
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:59,880
You're embarrassing me. Leave!

26
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,600
Leave? That homewrecker
should be the one to go.

27
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,680
Why should I be the one to leave?

28
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:06,480
- Move!
- Hey! What are you doing?

29
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,680
What are you doing? Hey!

30
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,560
You complained
about her repeatedly,

31
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:14,600
not because she did a bad job,

32
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,760
but because you were afraid
she would replace you...

33
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,360
and take everything away from you.

34
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:20,160
You were afraid she would
become the new Mrs. Shek, right?

35
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:22,080
Who does this woman think she is?

36
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,520
She's still wet behind the ears.
Why would I be afraid of her?

37
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:27,360
Witness, please watch your language.

38
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:34,840
According to the bank teller's
statement,

39
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,400
shortly after the events
in this video,

40
00:03:37,880 --> 00:03:39,160
you used a power of attorney,

41
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:41,720
citing Shek Chung's old age
and illness,

42
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,360
to go to the bank in person...

43
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:46,080
and transfer 30 million dollars
in cash from his account...

44
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:47,360
into your own account.

45
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,560
You were afraid that Shek Chung...

46
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:50,960
would find someone new
and change his will.

47
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:53,000
So you moved all his money first.

48
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:56,400
But then the plaintiff in this case,

49
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:57,880
Mr. Shek Kwong Sing, found out.

50
00:03:58,480 --> 00:03:59,920
He then informed Shek Chung.

51
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,880
That's why Shek Chung was
very angry.

52
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:04,840
And that's why
you moved out, isn't it?

53
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:07,000
No. Stop framing me.

54
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:12,560
You moved out
when Shek Chung was seriously ill.

55
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:15,920
You didn't even visit him
until he passed away. Correct?

56
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,160
Yes, because I was
still angry with him.

57
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:21,480
Because you didn't even visit him...

58
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,920
when he was seriously ill,

59
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:25,200
he was so disheartened that...

60
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,560
he definitely had a motive
to change his will before he died,

61
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:30,320
leaving all his assets to his son,

62
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,720
Shek Kwong Sing.

63
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:33,080
Do you agree?

64
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,160
I disagree.

65
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:36,000
Isn't it normal
for couples to argue?

66
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,360
How could he possibly leave me
only one dollar because of that?

67
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:39,880
It's that brat.

68
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,480
He drove a wedge between us...

69
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,480
while his dad was
sick and delirious.

70
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,800
He instigated him
to change the will.

71
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,120
Even a fool can see that.

72
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:47,440
Your Honor,
I have no further questions.

73
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:51,040
Witness, the opposing counsel is
just doing his duty.

74
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:53,360
If his questions were
truly inappropriate,

75
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,680
I wouldn't have allowed them.

76
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:57,520
As a witness,
just answer the questions.

77
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:10,240
(Senior: Flat A, Building 3,
326 Mong Kok Road)

78
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,480
326 Mong Kok Road.

79
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,120
Oh.

80
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:28,920
So Kwan Nga moved here.

81
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,120
No wonder no one could find her.

82
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,840
Can you stop scaring me like that?

83
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:40,400
Sorry, I was talking
to my other personality.

84
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,480
Don't mind me.

85
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,840
Your mentor's cross-examination...

86
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,720
really put my wife
on the spot today.

87
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:53,240
It looks like a sure win this time.

88
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:55,040
Making the judge see Miu Wah...

89
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,680
as a dishonest witness is important,

90
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,320
but the court
ultimately relies on evidence.

91
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,760
We're at a disadvantage
in that regard.

92
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:03,640
That's why the will
in your drawer is so important.

93
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:06,920
If we can't find it,

94
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,200
is it likely the court will rule...

95
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:10,000
that my will is invalid?

96
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:11,080
Of course.

97
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:14,000
You were too soft-hearted
to give it to the law firm.

98
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:15,360
That's why it's such a mess now.

99
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,320
We're family after all.

100
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,120
Does everything have
to be about money?

101
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:23,000
There's still affection involved.

102
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:25,680
Now that you're dead,
it's all about money again.

103
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:29,880
The world is quite funny.

104
00:06:29,960 --> 00:06:31,160
Even ghosts are talking about money.

105
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:35,000
Money is the most practical thing.
It gives you a sense of security.

106
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:36,680
Affection is all fake.

107
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:41,800
I've seen all kinds of people.

108
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:44,960
I bet you don't have a family.

109
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:49,040
Or maybe you aren't close to them.

110
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:51,080
None of your business.

111
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,560
Hello.

112
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:05,400
I'm Yau Yam Yam, the lawyer
representing Shek Kwong Sing.

113
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,680
Did Chung ever give you a will?

114
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:14,080
Did he ask you to put it
in a wooden box at his office?

115
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,680
How did you know?

116
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,560
The will isn't at his office.

117
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,040
Where did you put it?

118
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,120
They're in the middle of a lawsuit.

119
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:28,880
That will is very important
to his son.

120
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:35,960
After I put the will
at the office for Chung,

121
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,960
I kept the key the whole time.

122
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,520
Until he died...

123
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:43,280
and Mrs. Shek came to see me.

124
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,560
Do you still have Chung's pipe?

125
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:52,680
Chung asked me to keep it for him.

126
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:54,280
He wanted it back
when he was discharged.

127
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,240
He has already passed away.

128
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:57,360
And you're still keeping his things.

129
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:59,000
I could sue you for theft.

130
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:08,840
Are you hiding anything else?

131
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:12,640
If I find out you're still hiding
Chung's belongings,

132
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,960
I'll definitely sue you.

133
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:17,280
Wait a minute.

134
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,280
What key is this?

135
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:27,240
It's gone.

136
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,760
Why did you
give Mrs. Shek the key...

137
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,760
when you knew
what was inside the wooden box?

138
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:34,000
It's their family matter after all.

139
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,720
I didn't want to get into trouble.

140
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,000
How did Chung treat you
when he was alive?

141
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:47,880
Very well.

142
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,800
He trusted you,

143
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:51,760
which is why he entrusted you
with his most important possession.

144
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,840
And look what happened.

145
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:55,520
Forget it.

146
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,840
Tell her it's okay.

147
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,680
I know how ruthless my wife can be.

148
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:02,960
If I were Chung,
I wouldn't be able to rest in peace.

149
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:05,040
I'd rise from the grave and curse
your ancestors for 18 generations.

150
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:08,160
Hey, what are you talking about?

151
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,760
She was forced to do it.

152
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:11,720
Why are you making her feel guilty?

153
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:15,400
Chung, I'm sorry.

154
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:17,640
I didn't want to do it.
Please don't haunt me.

155
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:20,240
- I'm sorry.
- All right.

156
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,480
I forgive you.

157
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,080
Tell her.

158
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:25,680
How can he forgive you
if you don't do something for him?

159
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,320
You...

160
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,680
Why are you twisting my words?

161
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:30,880
Then what can I do?

162
00:09:36,983 --> 00:09:39,423
That woman must have taken my will.

163
00:09:39,903 --> 00:09:40,903
I suspect...

164
00:09:41,743 --> 00:09:43,223
she might have burned it already.

165
00:09:45,983 --> 00:09:47,463
If we don't think of something,

166
00:09:48,143 --> 00:09:49,823
she'll take all my assets.

167
00:09:53,463 --> 00:09:56,023
Hey. Stop playing with that plushie.

168
00:09:56,823 --> 00:09:58,583
Hurry up and think of a plan.

169
00:10:03,183 --> 00:10:05,463
I have a plan. It should work.

170
00:10:06,583 --> 00:10:07,583
What is it?

171
00:10:09,303 --> 00:10:10,303
But there's a condition.

172
00:10:12,423 --> 00:10:14,463
You're in no position to negotiate.

173
00:10:15,103 --> 00:10:16,223
Don't forget,

174
00:10:16,663 --> 00:10:19,023
I'm the one
who bought you a longer lifespan.

175
00:10:19,543 --> 00:10:20,543
So what?

176
00:10:20,863 --> 00:10:22,263
You're still
relying on me right now.

177
00:10:22,983 --> 00:10:24,423
You don't have the upper hand.

178
00:10:25,503 --> 00:10:26,623
I could just do nothing.

179
00:10:27,143 --> 00:10:28,703
You can send me back
to get my tongue cut.

180
00:10:29,743 --> 00:10:31,063
But then you'll
just have to watch...

181
00:10:31,383 --> 00:10:33,263
as your wife takes all your money.

182
00:10:33,703 --> 00:10:34,703
We'll both lose.

183
00:10:35,623 --> 00:10:36,623
You...

184
00:10:37,223 --> 00:10:39,623
I've never seen a woman
as shameless as you.

185
00:10:39,703 --> 00:10:41,063
That's exactly why you chose me.

186
00:10:44,743 --> 00:10:46,663
Fine. What's the condition?

187
00:10:47,903 --> 00:10:49,103
I want you to help me stay...

188
00:10:49,103 --> 00:10:50,183
in the mortal world a bit longer.

189
00:10:50,823 --> 00:10:51,943
I don't care how you do it.

190
00:10:52,503 --> 00:10:54,663
I don't want to leave
as soon as this is settled.

191
00:10:56,463 --> 00:10:58,863
You'll have to go down and get
your tongue cut sooner or later.

192
00:10:59,383 --> 00:11:01,543
Don't you want to get it over with
so you can be reincarnated?

193
00:11:01,823 --> 00:11:03,383
I still have
a lot of unfinished business.

194
00:11:03,703 --> 00:11:04,703
Do you think you're the only one?

195
00:11:05,303 --> 00:11:06,663
But as for how long you can stay,

196
00:11:06,743 --> 00:11:08,223
it's really not up to me.

197
00:11:10,663 --> 00:11:12,943
In that case...

198
00:11:15,343 --> 00:11:18,103
Let's just give up and do nothing.

199
00:11:21,503 --> 00:11:23,103
Instead of spending time
helping you,

200
00:11:24,383 --> 00:11:25,823
I'd rather spend time
with my family,

201
00:11:26,983 --> 00:11:28,423
even if it's just
for one more minute.

202
00:11:34,663 --> 00:11:37,223
Fine, I'll try my best.

203
00:11:37,503 --> 00:11:40,023
I don't want "try".
I want a guarantee.

204
00:11:42,863 --> 00:11:46,823
Fine, don't worry.
I'll definitely help you.

205
00:11:49,623 --> 00:11:50,623
Why should I trust you?

206
00:11:53,143 --> 00:11:54,743
I am Shek Chung.

207
00:11:55,383 --> 00:11:57,783
I have a name,
a reputation, and status.

208
00:11:58,423 --> 00:11:59,943
As the saying goes, a real man...

209
00:12:00,263 --> 00:12:02,783
never goes back on his word.

210
00:12:04,743 --> 00:12:07,743
Do you not believe me,
or do you look down on me?

211
00:12:09,863 --> 00:12:11,743
Fine, I believe you.

212
00:12:14,583 --> 00:12:15,703
So what's your plan?

213
00:12:16,943 --> 00:12:17,943
I want to ask,

214
00:12:19,023 --> 00:12:20,783
is there a way
to get into your house?

215
00:13:33,183 --> 00:13:34,183
Wait a second.

216
00:13:49,423 --> 00:13:50,423
Where is your study?

217
00:13:56,223 --> 00:13:57,223
Further up.

218
00:14:04,863 --> 00:14:05,863
Which pen do you usually use?

219
00:14:07,383 --> 00:14:08,383
It's in this drawer.

220
00:14:11,303 --> 00:14:12,303
This one.

221
00:14:14,023 --> 00:14:15,303
I need paper
with your fingerprints on it.

222
00:14:15,583 --> 00:14:16,823
Which paper did you touch
when you were alive?

223
00:14:17,463 --> 00:14:19,343
I've always used
this kind of notepad.

224
00:14:19,823 --> 00:14:21,063
I've used it for decades.

225
00:14:30,783 --> 00:14:31,983
What are you up to?

226
00:14:32,063 --> 00:14:33,623
I'll tell you later. Let's go.

227
00:14:44,583 --> 00:14:47,103
It's all your fault. Why did you
make sweet and sour pork?

228
00:14:47,183 --> 00:14:48,703
Now my throat is too dry
to sing today.

229
00:14:49,103 --> 00:14:50,703
Go make me a cup of Golden Throat
to soothe my voice.

230
00:16:17,663 --> 00:16:21,503
Breaking things again?

231
00:16:21,903 --> 00:16:23,303
I'll deduct it from your salary.

232
00:16:25,583 --> 00:16:26,743
You're such a useless glutton.

233
00:16:27,023 --> 00:16:29,223
All you do is eat. When you
actually work, you break things.

234
00:16:37,343 --> 00:16:39,143
You're really afraid of your wife.

235
00:16:40,143 --> 00:16:41,623
I'm not afraid of her.

236
00:16:42,743 --> 00:16:44,903
I just used too much energy.
I'm tired.

237
00:16:45,783 --> 00:16:47,183
I'm going back to rest.

238
00:16:48,263 --> 00:16:49,863
I thought you ghosts were powerful.

239
00:16:50,383 --> 00:16:51,543
Turns out you're so weak.

240
00:16:52,103 --> 00:16:53,303
Vengeful spirits are powerful.

241
00:16:53,303 --> 00:16:54,783
Ordinary ghosts like us...

242
00:16:54,863 --> 00:16:58,383
use a lot of energy just to blow air
or pick up a piece of paper.

243
00:16:59,823 --> 00:17:01,383
I can't go on.

244
00:17:02,103 --> 00:17:03,103
I'm leaving.

245
00:17:03,863 --> 00:17:05,543
I haven't told you my plan yet.

246
00:17:09,063 --> 00:17:11,983
(Ben: I found it. See you tonight.)

247
00:17:31,263 --> 00:17:32,263
Over there.

248
00:17:44,583 --> 00:17:45,583
Where exactly?

249
00:17:46,983 --> 00:17:48,463
I asked every car enthusiast group
in Hong Kong...

250
00:17:48,543 --> 00:17:50,263
before I finally found a lead.

251
00:17:50,983 --> 00:17:53,583
I've done well.
Give me a compliment.

252
00:17:54,863 --> 00:17:55,943
It's useless if there's no result.

253
00:17:58,023 --> 00:17:59,823
Then let's go door to door.

254
00:18:00,383 --> 00:18:01,423
And how would you ask?

255
00:18:01,503 --> 00:18:03,703
"Hi, have you been trying
to kill me lately?" Like that?

256
00:18:04,663 --> 00:18:06,423
Maybe someone knows something.

257
00:18:06,503 --> 00:18:08,103
How would we know if we don't ask?

258
00:18:10,823 --> 00:18:12,263
What are you doing here?

259
00:18:16,343 --> 00:18:18,183
- Do you live here?
- What's the matter?

260
00:18:19,863 --> 00:18:22,343
I'm looking for someone.
Have you seen this person?

261
00:18:24,743 --> 00:18:25,743
I don't know.

262
00:18:28,783 --> 00:18:29,783
Sorry to bother you.

263
00:18:31,503 --> 00:18:33,903
Forget it. It's like looking
for a needle in a haystack.

264
00:18:34,103 --> 00:18:35,223
I'll go back and wait
for my senior's news.

265
00:18:36,743 --> 00:18:38,463
It won't hurt to ask.

266
00:18:49,543 --> 00:18:50,543
Going home?

267
00:19:09,703 --> 00:19:10,703
It's him!

268
00:19:28,450 --> 00:19:29,450
Where is he?

269
00:19:30,530 --> 00:19:31,530
He's gone.

270
00:19:34,410 --> 00:19:35,410
Stop it!

271
00:19:35,890 --> 00:19:36,890
Let go!

272
00:20:34,370 --> 00:20:36,290
Remember to ice it every day.

273
00:20:37,490 --> 00:20:39,890
Twice a day,
for about 15 minutes each.

274
00:20:40,890 --> 00:20:42,370
It should heal in about a week.

275
00:20:54,610 --> 00:20:56,690
Did you offend a martial arts master
or a circus performer?

276
00:20:57,130 --> 00:20:58,130
He's crazy.

277
00:20:58,850 --> 00:20:59,850
Who knows?

278
00:21:00,810 --> 00:21:01,890
I've offended so many people.

279
00:21:02,650 --> 00:21:05,850
How about I be your bodyguard?
I'm a good fighter.

280
00:21:06,770 --> 00:21:08,970
No, thanks, I can handle it.

281
00:21:15,570 --> 00:21:16,890
I'm not helping you for the money.

282
00:21:17,770 --> 00:21:19,290
Our relationship has
always been about money.

283
00:21:22,570 --> 00:21:24,410
Relationships can change.

284
00:21:25,450 --> 00:21:26,450
Take this and go.

285
00:21:37,610 --> 00:21:38,610
What are you actually afraid of?

286
00:21:42,410 --> 00:21:44,010
- You really don't need me to stay?
- No.

287
00:23:04,370 --> 00:23:06,170
(Lai King Hotel Heir's Barrister
Helps Him Fight Off Rape Accusation)

288
00:23:09,730 --> 00:23:11,090
(Singer Wong Man Na Found Not Guilty
of Reckless Driving)

289
00:23:14,250 --> 00:23:15,930
(Mentally Unstable Woman Found Naked
and Wandering in Public at Night...)

290
00:23:15,930 --> 00:23:17,290
(Was a Rape Victim)

291
00:23:23,170 --> 00:23:24,570
(Property Owners Forced to Relocate
Protest Insufficient Compensation)

292
00:23:24,570 --> 00:23:25,570
(Female Victim's Brother
Arrested...)

293
00:23:25,570 --> 00:23:26,810
(After Causing a Disturbance
at Leather Tycoon's Mansion)

294
00:23:32,050 --> 00:23:33,170
(Owner of Nuen Lap Brand's
Inheritance Dispute of the Century)

295
00:23:33,170 --> 00:23:34,170
(Male Partner and Widow
Reach a Settlement)

296
00:23:39,050 --> 00:23:42,010
(Widow of Nuen Lap Brand's Owner
Seeks Psychological Counseling)

297
00:23:42,050 --> 00:23:43,930
(Chiu Man Wah)

298
00:23:43,930 --> 00:23:44,930
(Chan Shuk Ching)

299
00:23:47,690 --> 00:23:49,290
(Chiu Man Wah, Chan Shuk Ching,
Liu Chi Wai, Tsang Hei Lok)

300
00:23:49,290 --> 00:23:51,370
I wonder how many more good deeds
I need to do.

301
00:23:57,650 --> 00:23:59,250
Looks like I have to bet big on him.

302
00:23:59,250 --> 00:24:01,130
(Shek Chung)

303
00:24:40,050 --> 00:24:42,290
(Your VIP Reincarnation Application
has entered the parent-match stage.)

304
00:24:42,290 --> 00:24:43,650
(Please visit
the Reincarnation Office...)

305
00:24:43,650 --> 00:24:44,730
(within two working days to complete
the relevant procedures.)

306
00:24:44,770 --> 00:24:50,410
(VIP, Commoners)

307
00:25:02,530 --> 00:25:03,530
Excuse me.

308
00:25:07,170 --> 00:25:08,170
Excuse me.

309
00:25:08,570 --> 00:25:10,970
I received a text to come
and handle the paperwork.

310
00:25:16,050 --> 00:25:18,170
Pick a couple to be your parents.

311
00:25:19,770 --> 00:25:20,770
What?

312
00:25:23,170 --> 00:25:25,330
Isn't this the youngest son
of the yacht tycoon?

313
00:25:25,570 --> 00:25:27,130
Is he becoming a father so soon?

314
00:25:27,690 --> 00:25:29,250
(Select)

315
00:25:29,250 --> 00:25:31,210
Seventh Uncle?
Isn't this Seventh Uncle?

316
00:25:32,610 --> 00:25:34,090
Is he having a child
in his seventies?

317
00:25:34,650 --> 00:25:36,050
He's still going strong.

318
00:25:37,610 --> 00:25:40,050
Both families are good.

319
00:25:41,730 --> 00:25:43,570
By the way, I have a question.

320
00:25:43,890 --> 00:25:45,010
If I choose one,

321
00:25:45,090 --> 00:25:46,970
will I be reincarnated soon?

322
00:25:47,450 --> 00:25:48,610
Of course.

323
00:25:49,650 --> 00:25:51,770
How long will it take
for me to leave?

324
00:25:52,170 --> 00:25:54,170
You can reincarnate
when she gives birth.

325
00:25:54,170 --> 00:25:55,170
Since you've been asked to choose,

326
00:25:55,170 --> 00:25:57,090
it means they are
about to give birth.

327
00:25:58,930 --> 00:25:59,930
It's like this.

328
00:26:00,290 --> 00:26:02,090
I still have some family matters
to take care of.

329
00:26:02,930 --> 00:26:05,250
Can you reserve this spot for me?

330
00:26:05,570 --> 00:26:06,970
I'll give you an answer later.

331
00:26:07,210 --> 00:26:08,210
Later?

332
00:26:08,530 --> 00:26:11,450
Do you know how many people
are waiting to be reincarnated?

333
00:26:11,530 --> 00:26:14,410
Yes, I understand.

334
00:26:15,490 --> 00:26:18,530
Thank you. It's just
for a few more days.

335
00:26:19,970 --> 00:26:20,970
A few days.

336
00:26:22,570 --> 00:26:23,570
I'll do my best.

337
00:26:25,210 --> 00:26:26,250
Shek Chung.

338
00:26:28,610 --> 00:26:29,850
Shek Chung.

339
00:26:29,850 --> 00:26:31,490
(Grave of Shek Chung)

340
00:26:34,410 --> 00:26:35,410
Shek Chung.

341
00:26:36,890 --> 00:26:37,890
Shek Chung.

342
00:26:38,650 --> 00:26:39,650
Come out.

343
00:26:42,810 --> 00:26:43,810
Shek Chung.

344
00:26:46,410 --> 00:26:47,410
Shek Chung.

345
00:27:00,410 --> 00:27:01,530
You're fully charged, right?

346
00:27:02,610 --> 00:27:03,610
What is it?

347
00:27:04,450 --> 00:27:06,530
You're in court tomorrow.
There's no more time.

348
00:27:06,970 --> 00:27:08,650
We need to test the plan now.

349
00:27:09,130 --> 00:27:11,010
What exactly is your plan?

350
00:27:11,930 --> 00:27:14,810
Remember the jukebox in hell?

351
00:27:15,130 --> 00:27:16,770
Wasn't there a "possession" option?

352
00:27:18,850 --> 00:27:19,850
So what?

353
00:27:19,890 --> 00:27:21,570
Then you can rewrite your will.

354
00:27:24,930 --> 00:27:26,370
I went to your house...

355
00:27:26,450 --> 00:27:27,490
to get a piece of paper
with your fingerprints on it...

356
00:27:27,850 --> 00:27:30,410
so you can possess someone
and rewrite the draft will.

357
00:27:31,010 --> 00:27:32,330
The handwriting will
be yours, of course.

358
00:27:33,010 --> 00:27:35,890
I'll get handwriting experts
to verify it.

359
00:27:36,450 --> 00:27:38,530
Even if your wife
burned the original,

360
00:27:38,970 --> 00:27:40,050
she'll have nothing to say.

361
00:27:40,050 --> 00:27:42,530
But I've never
possessed anyone before.

362
00:27:42,610 --> 00:27:43,730
I don't know how to do it.

363
00:27:44,050 --> 00:27:46,210
If you don't want your wife
to get the money,

364
00:27:46,530 --> 00:27:47,770
go and find out how.

365
00:27:49,770 --> 00:27:52,170
You need three things
for possession.

366
00:27:52,250 --> 00:27:53,770
First, the ghost must have money.

367
00:27:54,970 --> 00:27:56,250
Possession is very expensive.

368
00:27:56,770 --> 00:27:58,250
Second, the person must
have enough yin energy.

369
00:27:58,330 --> 00:28:00,250
That's why there are spirit mediums,
but they're always women.

370
00:28:00,610 --> 00:28:02,290
Third, you must think of each other.

371
00:28:02,290 --> 00:28:03,330
You have to be
thinking of the ghost,

372
00:28:03,330 --> 00:28:04,930
and the ghost must
simultaneously press...

373
00:28:04,930 --> 00:28:05,930
the "Possess" button.

374
00:28:06,850 --> 00:28:08,810
Each possession
lasts 30 minutes at most.

375
00:28:08,890 --> 00:28:11,170
Exceed 30 minutes,
and your soul will be scattered.

376
00:28:11,410 --> 00:28:12,890
Also, here's another tip.

377
00:28:12,970 --> 00:28:15,010
Many spirit mediums don't
have enough yin energy.

378
00:28:15,090 --> 00:28:16,490
But a woman who has returned
from the dead...

379
00:28:16,570 --> 00:28:17,890
is guaranteed to work every time.

380
00:28:24,690 --> 00:28:26,370
I also want you
to write a love letter to your wife.

381
00:28:27,690 --> 00:28:28,690
Why?

382
00:28:29,250 --> 00:28:30,330
Just do as I say.

383
00:28:32,930 --> 00:28:35,810
Will this lousy idea of yours work?

384
00:28:36,570 --> 00:28:38,650
Why not? It'll be
in your own handwriting.

385
00:28:39,210 --> 00:28:41,970
But isn't this immoral?

386
00:28:42,490 --> 00:28:44,210
Will the King of Hell drag you back?

387
00:28:44,690 --> 00:28:45,690
I'm immoral?

388
00:28:46,410 --> 00:28:48,370
Your wife burning your will
is immoral.

389
00:28:48,970 --> 00:28:50,810
I'm doing a good deed
by helping you.

390
00:28:56,970 --> 00:28:58,370
What's taking so long?

391
00:30:12,243 --> 00:30:13,243
(Shek Chung)

392
00:30:26,003 --> 00:30:27,043
I don't know what to write.

393
00:30:28,163 --> 00:30:29,923
What sweet talk
is there left to say?

394
00:30:41,483 --> 00:30:43,683
This is all good stuff.

395
00:30:50,923 --> 00:30:52,883
This woman can really drink.

396
00:31:05,723 --> 00:31:06,923
The taste of the human world...

397
00:31:08,643 --> 00:31:09,643
is indeed different.

398
00:31:21,683 --> 00:31:23,563
(Shek Chung's Wedding Banquet)

399
00:31:30,443 --> 00:31:32,243
Congratulations, Mr. and Mrs. Shek.

400
00:31:32,603 --> 00:31:35,403
Chung says he has a few words
for his wife.

401
00:31:36,483 --> 00:31:37,883
My dear Miu Wah.

402
00:31:39,363 --> 00:31:42,363
My soulmate, my lover.

403
00:31:43,483 --> 00:31:44,763
You're so gentle.

404
00:31:45,803 --> 00:31:47,363
You're so exquisite.

405
00:31:49,163 --> 00:31:50,643
You're the reason...

406
00:31:51,763 --> 00:31:53,123
I, Shek Chung, live.

407
00:31:54,403 --> 00:31:57,083
Chung, don't be so mushy.

408
00:31:57,163 --> 00:32:00,163
If not at our wedding,
then when can I be mushy?

409
00:32:01,083 --> 00:32:02,083
Music!

410
00:32:03,203 --> 00:32:07,523
If I could fly a rocket
to take you to the sky

411
00:32:08,163 --> 00:32:11,123
We would live together in space

412
00:32:12,363 --> 00:32:16,243
Even at a thousand years old,
we would still be in love

413
00:32:16,523 --> 00:32:20,203
It's so much fun

414
00:32:21,483 --> 00:32:24,963
With you by my side

415
00:32:29,883 --> 00:32:32,763
Mr. and Mrs. Shek,
how did you two start dating?

416
00:32:33,323 --> 00:32:36,363
Chung pursued me because...

417
00:32:36,443 --> 00:32:37,963
I have a slim waist.

418
00:32:38,683 --> 00:32:41,403
I used to love fried food.

419
00:32:41,483 --> 00:32:45,923
But for this waist,
I gave it up for 10 whole years.

420
00:32:46,363 --> 00:32:48,243
That's a big sacrifice.

421
00:32:48,323 --> 00:32:49,323
Was it worth it?

422
00:32:49,963 --> 00:32:51,043
Of course it was.

423
00:32:52,803 --> 00:32:55,243
What about Sing Sing?
Can you eat fried food?

424
00:32:55,243 --> 00:32:56,283
(Shek Chung and Wife
Show Off Their Love in an Interview)

425
00:32:56,283 --> 00:32:57,283
Why?

426
00:32:57,283 --> 00:32:59,763
If Mom doesn't eat it,
I won't either.

427
00:33:03,923 --> 00:33:05,083
That's so sweet.

428
00:33:05,163 --> 00:33:06,643
You're such a happy family.

429
00:33:41,723 --> 00:33:43,563
(Shek Chung, December 4, 2024)

430
00:33:43,563 --> 00:33:47,203
(Dear Miu Wah)

431
00:33:53,283 --> 00:33:54,283
Are you kidding me?

432
00:33:55,923 --> 00:33:56,963
I couldn't even bear to drink it.

433
00:33:59,283 --> 00:34:01,643
Shek Chung, pay up!

434
00:34:05,843 --> 00:34:07,163
Are you Shek Chung?

435
00:34:08,563 --> 00:34:11,203
Shek Chung, is it really you?

436
00:34:12,323 --> 00:34:14,563
I really liked you when I was young.

437
00:34:14,803 --> 00:34:16,523
I never thought
I would get to see you...

438
00:34:16,603 --> 00:34:18,563
this close after I died.

439
00:34:18,923 --> 00:34:20,403
Can I take a photo with you?

440
00:34:23,363 --> 00:34:24,763
I'm so happy
to take a photo with you.

441
00:34:24,843 --> 00:34:25,843
Thank you.

442
00:34:26,603 --> 00:34:27,643
Thank you.

443
00:34:32,523 --> 00:34:33,523
Give me another glass.

444
00:34:49,203 --> 00:34:50,283
One more glass.

445
00:35:05,963 --> 00:35:07,203
Are you Shek Chung?

446
00:35:14,083 --> 00:35:15,363
Are you Shek Chung?

447
00:35:24,203 --> 00:35:25,523
I'm not disturbing you, am I?

448
00:35:25,603 --> 00:35:28,083
No.

449
00:35:28,443 --> 00:35:30,283
I'm just a little drunk.

450
00:35:31,043 --> 00:35:33,243
I'll order you a cup of tea...

451
00:35:33,323 --> 00:35:34,403
to help you sober up.

452
00:35:34,763 --> 00:35:36,603
No need.

453
00:35:37,323 --> 00:35:38,323
By the way,

454
00:35:38,323 --> 00:35:41,163
would you do me the honor
of dancing with me?

455
00:35:43,323 --> 00:35:44,443
Sure.

456
00:35:52,803 --> 00:35:55,163
What should I call you?

457
00:35:56,483 --> 00:35:57,523
My name is Miu Wah.

458
00:36:00,043 --> 00:36:02,603
That was how we first met.

459
00:36:04,123 --> 00:36:06,403
I often saw you in movies,

460
00:36:06,723 --> 00:36:09,443
so I feel like we're old friends.

461
00:36:11,443 --> 00:36:13,363
If only we could
stay like this forever,

462
00:36:13,963 --> 00:36:14,963
wouldn't that be wonderful?

463
00:36:15,803 --> 00:36:16,803
What?

464
00:36:18,203 --> 00:36:20,163
Nothing.

465
00:36:20,603 --> 00:36:23,763
I just meant you're a good dancer.

466
00:36:39,803 --> 00:36:42,163
Can you tell us
about the situation...

467
00:36:42,243 --> 00:36:44,963
when you saw Mr. Shek Chung
at the hospital?

468
00:36:55,563 --> 00:36:57,723
Dad.

469
00:36:59,603 --> 00:37:00,603
Dad.

470
00:37:04,003 --> 00:37:05,003
Son.

471
00:37:06,563 --> 00:37:07,923
I'll say it sentence by sentence.

472
00:37:09,163 --> 00:37:11,923
You write it down.

473
00:37:17,243 --> 00:37:18,323
In other words,

474
00:37:18,403 --> 00:37:22,803
you relayed Shek Chung's words
to the lawyer,

475
00:37:22,883 --> 00:37:26,443
rather than Shek Chung
telling the lawyer himself.

476
00:37:26,763 --> 00:37:27,763
Correct?

477
00:37:27,883 --> 00:37:28,883
Yes.

478
00:37:29,363 --> 00:37:32,523
At the time, only you heard
what Shek Chung said,

479
00:37:32,843 --> 00:37:35,683
and no one else was present?

480
00:37:36,283 --> 00:37:37,283
Yes.

481
00:37:38,163 --> 00:37:42,003
According to Dr. Liu Tak Keung's
witness statement,

482
00:37:42,443 --> 00:37:46,163
as Shek Chung's cancer had spread
before he passed away,

483
00:37:46,563 --> 00:37:51,243
he was injected with morphine
the day before he signed the will.

484
00:37:51,803 --> 00:37:52,803
Did you know that?

485
00:37:53,203 --> 00:37:54,203
I did.

486
00:37:54,363 --> 00:37:55,963
After Shek Chung
was injected with morphine,

487
00:37:56,043 --> 00:37:59,323
his reactions were slower
than before the injection.

488
00:37:59,643 --> 00:38:02,643
And his judgment was impaired.
Do you agree?

489
00:38:02,963 --> 00:38:03,963
I disagree.

490
00:38:04,683 --> 00:38:07,683
My dad was just speaking
a bit slowly and weakly that day.

491
00:38:08,163 --> 00:38:09,523
But his mind was very clear.

492
00:38:09,603 --> 00:38:10,683
He was very coherent.

493
00:38:11,203 --> 00:38:12,523
Now, when the will was signed,

494
00:38:12,603 --> 00:38:14,483
the attending doctor had
to perform an emergency surgery.

495
00:38:14,963 --> 00:38:16,763
He wasn't present, was he?

496
00:38:19,963 --> 00:38:20,963
No, he wasn't.

497
00:38:21,043 --> 00:38:23,083
So apart from your own testimony,

498
00:38:23,443 --> 00:38:24,923
there is absolutely nothing
to prove...

499
00:38:25,003 --> 00:38:28,083
that the will truly reflects
Shek Chung's actual wishes.

500
00:38:28,523 --> 00:38:30,003
Nor is there a doctor
who can prove...

501
00:38:30,083 --> 00:38:32,603
that Shek Chung signed the will...

502
00:38:32,683 --> 00:38:35,683
with full understanding
and consent of its contents.

503
00:38:36,283 --> 00:38:37,283
Do you agree?

504
00:38:43,363 --> 00:38:44,603
Witness, please answer the question.

505
00:38:47,803 --> 00:38:48,803
I agree.

506
00:38:52,803 --> 00:38:54,723
The law relies on evidence.

507
00:38:55,763 --> 00:38:57,563
You have no evidence
that Shek Chung...

508
00:38:57,643 --> 00:38:58,683
was lucid at the time.

509
00:38:58,963 --> 00:39:01,123
Nor are there
any witnesses to prove...

510
00:39:01,203 --> 00:39:03,003
that it was his true intention.

511
00:39:03,523 --> 00:39:04,523
Is that correct?

512
00:39:04,843 --> 00:39:06,763
Actually, three lawyers
were present that day.

513
00:39:07,323 --> 00:39:09,843
When the will was read out,
they all heard my dad...

514
00:39:09,843 --> 00:39:11,403
I have no further questions,
Your Honor.

515
00:39:29,203 --> 00:39:31,203
(Found the Draft Will)

516
00:39:32,123 --> 00:39:33,123
Your Honor,

517
00:39:33,443 --> 00:39:34,443
we have just discovered...

518
00:39:34,443 --> 00:39:36,363
important new evidence
and a witness.

519
00:39:36,843 --> 00:39:37,963
We request a recess...

520
00:39:38,443 --> 00:39:40,723
to consult with the plaintiff
as soon as possible.

521
00:39:41,163 --> 00:39:42,163
What is it?

522
00:39:42,203 --> 00:39:44,803
Shek Chung once left a draft will...

523
00:39:44,883 --> 00:39:45,883
at his office,

524
00:39:46,443 --> 00:39:48,323
which is the one I have
in my hand now.

525
00:39:48,763 --> 00:39:51,723
The contents of this draft will
and the final will...

526
00:39:51,803 --> 00:39:52,803
are an absolute match.

527
00:39:53,003 --> 00:39:54,563
Handwriting experts have verified...

528
00:39:54,643 --> 00:39:56,963
that it was written by Shek Chung.

529
00:39:57,883 --> 00:39:59,283
I am now submitting it
to Your Honor.

530
00:40:15,163 --> 00:40:16,403
Why are you only submitting it now?

531
00:40:17,043 --> 00:40:19,243
Because Shek Chung told his nurse,

532
00:40:19,323 --> 00:40:21,723
Ms. Leung Kwan Nga,
to take it to his office.

533
00:40:22,323 --> 00:40:24,003
I only managed to find her recently,

534
00:40:24,283 --> 00:40:25,603
which is when I learned
about this draft.

535
00:40:26,243 --> 00:40:27,643
This case has been ongoing
for so long,

536
00:40:27,723 --> 00:40:28,923
with so many reporters here
every day.

537
00:40:29,643 --> 00:40:31,283
If she held such important evidence,

538
00:40:31,363 --> 00:40:32,483
why didn't she come forward?

539
00:40:32,843 --> 00:40:34,603
We asked Ms. Leung the same thing.

540
00:40:35,083 --> 00:40:36,803
She said she didn't want
to be involved in this lawsuit.

541
00:40:37,363 --> 00:40:39,563
It wasn't until we found
and convinced her...

542
00:40:39,643 --> 00:40:40,883
that she finally changed her mind.

543
00:40:48,083 --> 00:40:50,563
Due to this important new evidence
and witness,

544
00:40:51,323 --> 00:40:54,443
the court is adjourned
until this afternoon.
